  "description": "pubky-music-specs `listening` contents (music v1, listening together, 2026-10-29). Each post is the v1 envelope with this kind and content, `embed` the song playing now, no parent, attachments or lock, validated under /pub. One post per listening session, a new version per song, pause or resume: `started_at` is when this song started, `paused_at` is set while paused, `ended_at` when the person stopped, `expires_at` (optional) when readers stop showing it. `valid` cases give what a reader shows for the person `display_name` (the `name`, or the generic name when it is absent) and, with `now`, the position a listener along plays from (`position_ms`, null once it isn't live). `invalid` cases are refused with an error naming `error`; `session`, from earlier drafts, is retired and refused as an unknown kind. `generic_names` are what a client may write when the person gave no name, and what a reader shows. Times are Unix microseconds.",
